        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Showhouse For Sale – Fully Furnished\r\n \r\nLuxury Coastal Living Meets Village Charm in Blackwater, Wexford\r\n\r\nAn exclusive development of beautifully crafted large 4 bedroom detached bungalows and dormer-style homes located in the picturesque village of Blackwater.\r\n \r\nDesigned with comfort, elegance and modern family living in  mind, these exceptional homes will feature :\r\n\r\nHigh spec contemporary finishes throughout\r\nAir to water heating\r\nHeat recovery system\r\nKitchen, Wardrobe & tiling allowance\r\nGranite patio and window sills\r\nCobble lock driveways\r\nPedestrian access to village centre\r\n \r\n\r\nLocation \r\n\r\nAn Goirtín Glas is conveniently located just a short stroll from the well-established village of Blackwater which offers bars, a café, a supermarket, the local primary school and the GAA pitch and only a short drIve to all of the wonderful amenities that the thriving town of Wexford has to offer which is just 15 km away. Ballyconnigar Beach is 3 kilometres away offering a beautiful sandy beach with stunning walks. Blackwater is sitting pretty as in 2023 it was named Ireland’s Best Kept Village. Blackwater Golf course is just 5km away."
